{"id": "DfLmQwWp5E8", "title": "Video by guipaulinooo", "description": "Someone just built a skill where you type one sentence and Claude builds a working 3D engine. ⚙️\n\nIt's called Teardown, it's free, and it runs inside Claude Code. You can spin the machine, cut it open and watch the part doing the work, with every gauge moving live.\n\nHow it works:\n1. Add the skill to Claude Code with one command\n2. Type the machine you want, plus one picture of the real thing\n3. Claude rebuilds it part by part, from real numbers\n\nIt works on anything that moves. Even a sandworm a kilometre long.\n\nComment \"TEARDOWN\" and I'll send you the free guide with all 9 prompts.\n\nSimulators by @elvar_official, shown with credit. Not affiliated with him or Anthropic.\n\n#claude #claudeai #claudecode #3d #engineering", "channel": "guipaulinooo", "uploader_id": "1433628924", "uploader": "Gui Paulino | AI Creative & Claude", "timestamp": 1793498075, "like_count": 7677, "comment_count": 6615, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1127427940152516a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 53.569, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMo5mec-iSvvDBC1v2voycLpn7X5zVOyzQrM5KvEYR-pfoJd2dPXhI-kHYB1Auy-skEFH13XycvHqIOycHqDoU97jzap-QERAJnUy8.mp4?_nc_cat=109&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=fxwq2BDeZA4Q7kNvwFv4UFb&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=furJGzGU43WYsSjRJjLQ5Q&_nc_ss=7a580&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&_nc_enc=Uv62R4kR3ySVIZlvzbMFhsrpZYWv8bXkTrdVCmXi8WgXUecupyBHn7PJjV5TsanthxW0TVV0hTnpa1TkwSTKp0ToqO0ZvHJ66xwjUOI-f8QAoVLIE6AdFBZS8-s&oh=00_AQTDM__iOWMm_rBXccCCnvXzcLwVFHBzuAdtWmsKVL_CTQ&oe=6B03CD0E", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 53.569, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-A